WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.382
Uchida's conjecture on Galois groups.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.575
Isomorphic Galois groups come from isomorphic fields.

3
00:00:05.575 --> 00:00:08.151
Uchida asked the same for open maps.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.803
Openness alone forces compatibility with roots of

5
00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:14.206
unity, and a known criterion finishes.

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.196
Claimed: every open map comes from fields.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.844
Not in Lean.
